  "notes": "与 v1.3.22 内容一致，修复了 macOS / iOS 因工具链升级导致的构建出包失败。\n\n## 用户可见修复\n\n- 与 v1.3.22 相同：删除正在使用的订阅会先停止内核再删除配置，避免「看着删了、流量却还在跑」。\n\n## 兼容性\n\n- 应用功能、账号、订阅、代理协议、更新签名公钥和各平台安装包升级身份均未改变。\n- 现有安装无需迁移。\n",
  "notesEn": "Identical to v1.3.22; fixes the macOS / iOS packaging build that failed after the toolchain upgrade.\n\n## User-visible fixes\n\n- Same as v1.3.22: deleting the subscription in use now stops the kernel before deleting the config, so \"looks deleted but traffic still flows\" can no longer happen.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n- App features, account, subscription, proxy protocols, update-signing public key, and per-platform installer upgrade identity are unchanged.\n- No migration is required for existing installs.\n",
